  "name": "Coastal Phalanx & Surging Tides",
  "description": "§e§lCoastal Phalanx:§r\nSneak and press your Primary Ability key while looking at a creature within 30 blocks to grant both of you Absorption II for 1 minute. The Absorption effect refreshes every 10 seconds.\n \n§e§lSurging Tides:§r\nPress your Primary Ability key while not sneaking to dash in the direction you are looking. Cooldown: 5 seconds while physically in water or exposed to rain, 30 seconds otherwise on land.\n \nYour projectile damage is reduced by 50% during Surging Tides and for 3 seconds afterward. §e§lMovement Ability§r."
